// A minimal Offspring carrier ([CR#702.175a]): "Offspring [cost]" — an optional
// additional cost that, if paid, makes a 1/1 token copy of this permanent when
// it enters. No canon-slice card carries Offspring (the copy grammar is brand
// new); isolates the CostOption + PaidCost-gated ETB token-copy expansion.
Normal(
    name: "Offspring Test Creature",
    mana_cost: [Generic(1), Green],
    types: [Creature],
    power: 2,
    toughness: 2,
    abilities: [
        Keyword(Offspring([Mana([Generic(1)])])),
    ],
)
